### ===================================================================
### PRUEBAS HTTP PARA AUTHENTICATION CONTROLLER
### ===================================================================

### 1. LOGIN EXITOSO - Credenciales correctas
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 2. LOGIN FALLIDO - Usuario incorrecto
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "usuario_inexistente",
  "password": "admin123"
}

### 3. LOGIN FALLIDO - Contraseña incorrecta
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "admin",
  "password": "contraseña_incorrecta"
}

### 4. LOGIN FALLIDO - Campos vacíos
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "username": "",
  "password": ""
}

### 5. LOGIN FALLIDO - Sin datos
POST http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{}

### ===================================================================
### VALIDACIÓN DE TOKEN
### ===================================================================

### 6. VALIDAR TOKEN - Token válido (usar token del login exitoso)
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer eyJhbGciOiJIUzM4NCJ9.eyJzdWIiOiJhZG1pbiIsImlhdCI6MTc2NDAxOTcyNCwiZXhwIjoxNzY0MTA2MTI0fQ.oox-tDkQ_yHn2rF1PyCl_7L0pA83djenyVJaJ1NwIKJ11Dxh01wy7tPdC6rsg9em

### 7. VALIDAR TOKEN - Token inválido
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/validate
Authorization: Bearer token_invalido_para_prueba

### 8. VALIDAR TOKEN - Sin header Authorization
GET http://localhost:8080/v1/auth/validate

### ===================================================================
### INSTRUCCIONES:
### 1. Ejecute primero el test de LOGIN EXITOSO
### 2. Copie el token del response
### 3. Reemplace "YOUR_JWT_TOKEN_HERE" con el token real
### 4. Use ese token en todas las pruebas administrativas
### ===================================================================